    "CLM_S_381061c3d5": {
      "claim_id": "CLM_S_381061c3d5",
      "claim_text": "PKD wasn't Christ; he passed through him - like a wind (pneumena), into the modern world. those to whom it (she) had bonded in symbiosis (homoplasmate) were killed, so it short circuited time to a reincarnation of one of The apostolic Xtians (homoplasmates) + thus ame here (to our time).",
